# eval/rc_scan (id 83): token walk of the record phase. PC 0 (or PC 2 = right after a sheet
# prefix): x0 = OPC. 0: write HEAD (T5) at T6+6 (formula record word 6), rc_chain PC 5. 5: read
# OPND at TP+1, rc_ref (84) PC 0, with T7 = the prefix sheet if entered at PC 2, else 0. 6 (range,
# added by the ABI agent, decision F7): read OPND at TP+1, rc_rng (36) PC 0, T7 as for 5, TP kept.
# 8: read OPND at TP+1, TP += 2, rc_ref PC 1 (stores the sheet in T7, reads [TP], back here at
# PC 2). else: TP += 2, read [TP], self PC 0. PC 1: same as "else" (advance after an edge).
# Note: weights/eval/recalc.md. Hand-written.
